[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Out of the Limelight]
[00:12.71]Why was their disguise 'too perfect'?
[00:19.37]An ancient bus stopped by a dry river bed and a party of famous actors and actresses got off.
[00:27.99]Dressed in dark glasses and old clothes,
[00:31.61]they had taken special precautions so that no one should recognize them.
[00:37.52]But as they soon discovered, disguises can sometimes be too perfect.
[00:45.84]'This is a wonderful place for a picnic,' said Gloria Gleam.
[00:51.81]'It couldn't be better, Gloria,' Brinksley Meers agreed.
[00:56.80]'No newspaper men, no film fans! Why don't we come more often?'
[01:03.21]Meanwhile, two other actors Rockwall Slinger and Merlin Greeves,
[01:11.11]had carried two large food baskets to a shady spot under some trees.
[01:18.18]When they had all made themselves comfortable, a stranger appeared.
[01:22.76]He looked very angry.
[01:26.14]'Now you get out of here, all of you!' he shouted.
[01:31.29]'I'm sheriff here. Do you see that notice? It says "No Camping"--in case you can't read!'
[01:42.91]'Look, sheriff,' said Rockwall,
[01:46.42]'don't be too hard on us. I'm Rockwall Slinger and this is Merlin Greeves.'
[01:54.63]'Oh, is it?' said the sheriff with a sneer.
[01:59.35]'Well, I'm Brinksley Meers,
[02:01.95]and my other name is Gloria Gleam
[02:04.95]Now you get out of here fast!'
